OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader resigns after fraud
OL,4,Aconviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Ashfield District Council
OL,7,Fhas resigned after being convicted of
OL,8,Ffraud and tax evasion.
OL,10,FJason Zadrozny, of Stanton Hill, was
OL,11,Faccused of setting up a fake heritage
OL,12,Fgroup to defraud Nottinghamshire County
OL,13,FCouncil out of thousands of pounds.
OL,15,FOn Monday at Northampton Crown Court,
OL,16,Fthe 46-year-old was found guilty of
OL,17,Fnine counts of fraud and four counts of
OL,18,Ftax evasion after a four-week trial.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
