OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader resigns after fraud
OL,4,Aconviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has also resigned from the Ashfield
OL,7,FIndependents group, but has not yet
OL,8,Fresigned as a councillor. He told the
OL,9,FBBC he was "considering things more
OL,10,Fdeeply".
